      "title": "Trial outcomes  --  $total_trials trials in session $session",
      "description": "How the selected session's trials ended. channel is the OUTCOME_* code from task.h: 0 hit, 1 incorrect, 2 no response, 3 abort. Whole session, no day bound.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "hathaway_pg"
